*** Test Cases ***
### SA

CB008940_L_3_Interworking_when_both_actSpatialStreamPooling_and_actBbPoolTddFr1_enabled
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the configuration ${C_Cell}
    ...                     Preparation of the TL is needed first (manually)
    ...                         actDlSrsBm is activated
    ...                         srsForBeamMgmt at Cell level
    ...                              <list name="srsForBeamMgmt">
    ...                                   <item>
    ...                                   <p name="bSRS">2</p>
    ...                                   <p name="cSRS">63</p>
    ...                                   <p name="srsPowerThresholdForDlBm">-1200</p>
    ...                                   <p name="srsTypeAllocForDlBm">antenna switching or codebook</p>
    ...                                   <p name="srsUePeriodicity">slots40</p>
    ...                                   </item>
    ...                              </list>
    ...                        actUeCsirsCoexistCellCsirs = TRUE
    ...                    In egate, you need to activate the Srs mode : cfg file modified by KW
    ...                                                       "Update Basic Configuration File for actDlSrsBm Test Mode"
    ...                      cell_srs_beam_pos_nr profile_id=1 num_of_ue_positions=4 azimuth=-40,-13,13,40
    ...                      cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=1 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...                      cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=2 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...                      cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=3 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...                      ----dict_ue1------------------------------------------------------------------
	...                      originalCell:                              =1
	...                      DL_throughput:                             =1200
	...                      DL_throughput_GBR:                         =0
	...                      UL_throughput:                             =0
	...                     ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	...                     ----dict_ue2------------------------------------------------------------------
	...                      originalCell:                              =2
	...                      DL_throughput:                             =175
	...                      DL_throughput_GBR:                         =0
	...                      UL_throughput:                             =0
	...                     ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	...                     ----dict_ue3------------------------------------------------------------------
	...                      originalCell:                              =3
	...                      DL_throughput:                             =1200
	...                      DL_throughput_GBR:                         =0
	...                      UL_throughput:                             =0
	...                     ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
	...                     ----vendor_custom_test--------------------------------------------------------
	...                      bbHwVariant:                               =ABIO
	...                      maxNumLayerPrbL1Sp:                        =1200
	...                      maxNumStreamPrbL1Sp:                       =1200
	...                      maxNumWbStreamPrbL1Sp:                     =600
	...                      maxNumScheUePdschL1Pool:                   =None
	...                      maxNumScheUePdschL1Sp:                     =None
	...                      ul_maxNumLayerPrbL1Sp_csSize32:            =410
	...                      ul_maxNumStreamPrbL1Sp_csSize32:           =820
	...                      ul_maxNumWbStreamPrbL1Sp_csSize32:         =None
	...                      ul_maxNumLayerPrbL1Sp_csSize64:            =820
	...                      ul_maxNumStreamPrbL1Sp_csSize64:           =1640
	...                      ul_maxNumWbStreamPrbL1Sp_csSize64:         =None
	...                    ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    ...     Actions:        based on dlTdSchedSubcellData,numAllocCellPrbDl , check prbstreamcapa as expected
    ...                      for subpool1 and subpoll2
    ...     Checks:
    ...     Verdict:        calls for multi ues and PRB pooling are passed
    [Tags]  EXCLUDE_CRT
    TC CB008940  ${C_Cell}    ${dictParam}    ${Vendor_IWK_CB8940-L_CB7113}    ${dict_settings_all_ues}    nrCell=3
    ...          kw Set RAD Params=Set RAD Params for 8940-L
    ...          kw NIDD Set=Set CB008940-L NIDD PARAMETERS with actSpatialStreamPooling
    ...          kw NIDD Check=Check CB008940-L NIDD PARAMETERS with actSpatialStreamPooling
    ...          kw Set TestMode=Update Basic Configuration File for actDlSrsBm Test Mode
    ...          NIDD_8940_PARAMS=${NIDD_8940_L_w_actSpatialStreamPooling_PARAMS}
    ...          Json test configuration=${relative_json_path}

[1.0] CB008940_L_01_Interaction_with_CB008238_Micro_DTX_optimized_scheduler_for_FR1_PRB_pooling
    [Documentation]
    ...     Conditions:     it is based on the configuration ${C_Cell}
    ...                     Preparation of the TL is needed first (manually)
    ...                         actDlSrsBm is activated
    ...                         srsForBeamMgmt at Cell level
    ...                              <list name="srsForBeamMgmt">
    ...                                   <item>
    ...                                   <p name="bSRS">2</p>
    ...                                   <p name="cSRS">63</p>
    ...                                   <p name="srsPowerThresholdForDlBm">-1200</p>
    ...                                   <p name="srsTypeAllocForDlBm">antenna switching or codebook</p>
    ...                                   <p name="srsUePeriodicity">slots40</p>
    ...                                   </item>
    ...                              </list>
    ...                        actUeCsirsCoexistCellCsirs = TRUE
    ...                    In egate, you need to activate the Srs mode : cfg file modified by KW
    ...                                                       "Update Basic Configuration File for actDlSrsBm Test Mode"
    ...                      cell_srs_beam_pos_nr profile_id=1 num_of_ue_positions=4 azimuth=-40,-13,13,40
    ...                      cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=1 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...                      cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=2 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...                      cell_testmode_set_nr cell_id=3 gnb=2 testmode=cell_srs_beam_pos profile_id=1 action=activate
    ...     ----vendor_custom_test--------------------------------------------------------
    ...          bbHwVariant:                               =ABIO
    ...          maxNumScheUePdschL1Pool:                   =None
    ...          maxNumScheUePdschL1Sp:                     =None
    ...          maxNumLayerPrbL1Sp:                        =600
    ...          maxNumStreamPrbL1Sp:                       =600
    ...          maxNumWbStreamPrbL1Sp:                     =600
    ...     ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
    ...     Actions:        it performs the call setup for multi-ues on different cells with DL traffic
    ...     Checks:         it checks nothing more than already done on lib.
    ...     Verdict:        calls for multi ues and PRB pooling are passed
    [Tags]   CRT
    TC CB008940  ${C_Cell}    ${dictParam}    ${VENDOR_CUSTOM_8940_L_tc_Micro_DTX}    ${dict_settings_all_ues}    nrCell=3
    ...          kw Set RAD Params=Set RAD Params for 8940-L
    ...          kw NIDD Set=Set CB008940-L NIDD PARAMETERS with actDtxOptimizedScheduler
    ...          kw NIDD Check=Check CB008940-L NIDD PARAMETERS with actDtxOptimizedScheduler
    ...          kw Set TestMode=Update Basic Configuration File for actDlSrsBm Test Mode
    ...          NIDD_8940_PARAMS=${NIDD_8940_L_W_actDtxOptimizedScheduler_PARAMS}
    ...          Kw TestLine Preparation=TL_Preparation_CB008940_L_MicroDTX_SCF
    ...          Kw_Convert_TtiTrace_From_csv_to_Dict_Test=Convert TTI trace from csv to dict CB008940 for MicroDtx TestCase
    ...          kw Check SCF parameters=verify_SCF_Paramaters_TC_MicroDtx
    ...          kw Specific Check=Check PRB Assignment CB008940-L MicroDTX
    ...          Json test configuration=${relative_json_path}

# test
#      Extract TTI Trace and Convert to Pickle For MicroDtx
